        "node_id": "n_2_7cba24",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the maximum distance Takahashi can travel in K moves, which is K * D. Determine the remainder when X is divided by D. The minimum absolute value will be the minimum of this remainder and the difference between K * D and this remainder.",
